  "_doc": "W2 mission templates. Tiers 1-4 escalate by target size, not by type. `metric` names a RunRecord field for singleRun/cumulative; `require` lists trick types for combo. `excludedRuleIds` names DailyPatch.RULES entries this template must not be offered under (see tests/src/missions.test.js for the compatibility assertion). Keep `title` <= 34 chars so it fits the MILESTONE strip. Airtime targets are per-jump maxAirtimeMs, measured achievable from real runs (tools/sim: single-jump airMs max 1772, median 796) \u2014 not total airtime. D7 (Marvin 2026-11-13): `tierUnlock` maps a mission tier to the Sync Level at which it becomes drawable. Low levels draw only low tiers; thresholds are data so tuning them needs no code change. Tier 1 is always open. Selection never leaves a slot empty \u2014 `drawMissions` falls back to the highest unlocked tier.",
